WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:00.970
- Speaking of new music,

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:03.190
so one of your new songs, Joanna,

00:00:03.190 --> 00:00:05.260
it kind of pushes against the media a bit.

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:07.200
It's like, could you talk
about that song a little bit?

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.040
- Absolutely, yeah.

00:00:08.040 --> 00:00:09.210
So my name is Joanna.

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:11.360
That's my real name

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.090
and it's just

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:17.040
like fans or, or just people online,

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.520
sometimes refer to me as Joanna.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.760
People think they,

00:00:20.760 --> 00:00:21.593
they know you

00:00:21.593 --> 00:00:23.690
or people think that
they can draw conclusions

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.020
and this is less about the media

00:00:25.020 --> 00:00:26.610
and more about kind of this cancel culture

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:28.200
that is so prevalent right now.

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.780
- Wow and--
- Especially

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.050
you know, on social media

00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:33.650
and we're just so quick
to write people off.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.600
You know, people need
to be held accountable

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:38.040
for heinous things that,

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.380
that's some people I understand, you know,

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:43.580
why there's this quickness to do that,

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.700
but when it comes to like saying someone's

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:48.790
peaked or they, they're done,

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:49.930
their career is over

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:52.220
because you haven't seen
them in a few months

00:00:52.220 --> 00:00:53.550
or a few years,
- Yeah.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:55.690
- that's just so ridiculous to me.

00:00:55.690 --> 00:00:56.560
So that's kind of what,

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:57.530
what the song is about.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:00:58.363
It's like,

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:03.180
everybody's just one moment away from,

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.750
you know, redemption or evolution

00:01:05.750 --> 00:01:06.870
or being back--

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:08.450
- Or whatever the next chapter is.

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.800
- Exactly, like you
can't write anybody off

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:14.630
and I'm, I'm low key a
prime example of that.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:16.880
So that's the kind of
what the song is about.

